  Assets:Cash   100 USD
  Assets:Euros  100 EUR @ USD

2020-02-02 * "Total price"
  Assets:Cash   100 USD
  Assets:Euros  100 EUR @@ USD

2020-02-03 * "Same signs in one currency"
  Assets:Euros  33.333 EUR
  Assets:Euros  100 EUR @ EUR

2020-02-04 * "Balances"
  Assets:Cash   -120 USD
  Assets:Euros  100 EUR @ USD
